    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d871b20f2f97d970e9b694bc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "真是美丽☆★☆\r\n送进你的心里★",
      "source_fingerprint": "3cd6e1062210eac94c0f12b8c79af9c12f608e86a612e270c063520fb8c0d52d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1055",
        "30004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0574568988bbecf49db94c9a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这、就、是……美丽～～☆★",
      "source_fingerprint": "8018fc0aba154498f330176347d60df375aec19d0c83945ab964f0fb7e0531fa",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1055",
        "30005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7c9f1a21843ea13505ff784d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "出发捕捉令人心跳加速的事物！",
      "source_fingerprint": "591e5b9dc0001f7a00c75227e50e9be6eb98e8442dfdf42c8c9225a3ca594256",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1055",
        "31000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:33080b97131a1da9f5aa7cd1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "把美丽带给全世界☆★☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "9ad390028b1dfe573eaba02c850154835e0bf311372f13fe6c291f69c19defc6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1055",
        "40000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:adc55926fb679c20d011cc01",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "（闻闻）……好香啊……☆\r\n嗯～我有新的美丽预感……★",
      "source_fingerprint": "adc144c57a2af4dd1e3c792b61b27d01c4e756432b092c55de9b9027e6524efa",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1055",
        "400002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:14c21c5cf9c387d72e2a060d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "世界每分每秒都\r\n非常美好！今天的美丽\r\n一定就从这里开始☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "ab754b593c2702e9ae76cb78498c582080e131c9f46f9e44db916fc4470be7d2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1055",
        "400004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c93cc741623e1e75717cb59e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我记得重炮有整套的\r\n《甜蜜回忆》……呵呵呵☆\r\n今晚可以开漫画派对了★",
      "source_fingerprint": "d129de0b51f14434e9b6323a6b8c846865767be8b94114ce08987655d7465b6b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1055",
        "400005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:005cc7c0d00a8b27d3747825",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要不要来点美丽搭配咖啡呢☆\r\n这是能让更多人获得幸福的魔法\r\n甜言蜜语★跟红茶也很搭喔☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "97ec553163df97b7913bc50c0d1c67a818974f44aa3e258e28a002254608ffa3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1055",
        "400009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5c465ebcad3cf2b1093b776a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "快看快看～！天空和花朵闪耀光芒☆\r\n世界是如～此美丽★☆★",
      "source_fingerprint": "043696ff931a22ff8b19d57a828346c106bb739cfe6420f36152d1fc0a197da4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1055",
        "40001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:15a72df71cc220282a81795c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啊哈，找到了呢☆\r\n努力完成许多活动任务，\r\n获得奖励吧★",
      "source_fingerprint": "b9000523b8deda4f5f3fdea662db6dcff318006ac919ed5eb788d606df482796",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1055",
        "400012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:578cea389616589325fead1d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "是美丽的礼物喔☆\r\n千万别漏掉任何一个奇迹的证明★",
      "source_fingerprint": "6c1f96a521ed0efd49e2f003f085e7e0757183d643822d06266c68a49460c12f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1055",
        "400013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6964372f421a8c068b2e047c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "把闪耀动人的我传达给大家吧☆★",
      "source_fingerprint": "0342252850b453ed124461865fb7379400767d8803ab0ce0358638200abeb872",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1055",
        "60000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a18051baa8c9417972285093",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "用我的舞蹈回报大家的声援！\r\n这是爱的交换～☆★☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "cd43b8aeb755d73650c7bbcf5a868e747ecd3ee1a2b3034b8287d6400f8fbbb2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1055",
        "60001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:34f273d8c67e87c19b2a4805",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "一起去寻找美丽吧──！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4c1774c72043b7426efeb7813f16e12b45d1a98e25470aa095ac330397b619c5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1055",
        "70000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2598c6a4ac906c4804c3c892",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "如果跟训练员一起，\r\n我觉得能够创造出\r\n更～特别的美丽☆★☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "f313c6d15619c39680a33b7bf282a19a6822b318dabf311e7e14e4644bf84365",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1055",
        "70001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a8f7bd4d57d2c8ce4dd7a729",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "传统就是温暖！制服真美丽☆★",
      "source_fingerprint": "7812d3beccef078b49980d6630c8cd9b545ec37434630df6d77ae3ffb64f7dd2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1055",
        "70004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8be52888fc69a786775067e6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "突然想跳舞了！\r\n噜啦啦～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "bae94c3f2055ecae5cd698595343b884c8b30bf36b4c8f1ffdcc45ceffe8f616",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1055",
        "70008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:295b1ab8bbec195b52fde912",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "充满心跳加速的美丽～～☆★",
      "source_fingerprint": "1a82c61abd1904f3cb8634a8e6f2a2e022e986c2ee0638eeefb6f3bcc15016d3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
